{"nodes":[{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nEx-husband and ex-wife; they divorced before the game begins, though they still co-parent Kris and Asriel.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nKris's mother; monarch of Hometown alongside Asgore before the divorce.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Asriel**\nAsriel's biological mother, whom she believed lost before his return in Ch.4.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Why did Tenna choose her?**\nTenna describes her as the one who appreciated him most, suggesting a prior relationship (real, or only perceived by Tenna?) between them before Ch.3 — it isn't fully explained why he chooses her specifically as…","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Toriel_Overworld.webp","x":-38,"y":-295,"width":96,"height":190},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Rudy**\nOld college friends; Rudy remembers her as much wilder and more energetic back then, to the point of having thrown a key lime pie at her at a party.","x":-680,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Toriel\n🍎 Teacher at Hometown's school, mother of Kris and Asriel, ex-wife of Asgore.","x":-200,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nHe kept her secretly locked up in a gachapon capsule during Ch.3, calling her his \"ace up his sleeve\".","x":-1000,"y":115,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel.png","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rudy_Overworld_1.png","x":-680,"y":270,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Tenna_Overworld_gif.gif","x":-1000,"y":-95,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Alphys**\nFriend and colleague at school; often asks her how Kris is doing in class. Alphys also tells her things about Susie, like her habit of eating chalk.","x":-340,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alphys_sprite_transparent_v2.png","x":-340,"y":290,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nShe found her crying by the cemetery before the game and took her to the QC Diner — a gesture that made Susie grow fond of her for the rest of the series. In Ch.4, she invites her to church and to stay the night.","x":0,"y":480,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":0,"y":290,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/tenna_with_dreemur_and_holiday.webp","x":-973,"y":-314,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5_x3","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}